note: Three whitepaper features (lawful-now):
(a) Meta AI REAL invocation — MetaDrafting service (FacilitatorDialogue
pattern): preset .meta = deepseek-v4-pro thinking ENABLED. Trigger 起草/draft/
帮我写 + active wizard → answered steps serialized as drafting context →
proposal text in summary_card titled "Meta AI 起草建议（提案，未写入）".
RED LINE 4 enforced structurally (session by value; meta path cannot reach any
wizardSession write site — verifier traced all three) + test asserts session
byte-equality across the full async flow. No wizard → deterministic
requires-wizard notice, zero gateway.
(b) 预算/budget intent → A1_19 BudgetProjections.budgetDraftCard FIRST TIME
wired into UI routing (wizard projectId or proj_default). Deterministic ×2.
(c) 批准/approval/审批 intent → A1_23 ApprovalEnvelopeBuilder demo draft with
all entropy injected as constants → exactly ONE .approvalRequest block →
first-party ApprovalCard render law verified (count==1, ViewIRRenderer sole
view path).

VERIFY: determinism-zerocall lens PASS (full findings incl. ApprovalCard
render-path uniqueness). redline4-golden lens FAILED on a REAL finding:
maxTokens=1024 too small for v4-pro thinking (reasoning consumes budget) AND
finish_reason=="length" decoded but never checked → silent truncation.
ARCHITECT FIX: maxTokens 1024→4096; truncation notice "（注：回复因长度上限
被截断）" appended in BOTH lanes (MetaDrafting + FacilitatorDialogue —
verifier's adjacent observation adopted). Golden updated. Verifier calibration
note recorded: A1_31 receipt did not log the probe's token budget — the 2048
figure came from the orchestrator's brief; the missing finish_reason guard was
independently source-verified.

UX note from implementer (recorded): triggers are substring matches — a wizard
ANSWER containing 起草/预算/批准 will route to the new intents instead of
being recorded as an answer. Matches card wording; future refinement candidate.

271 tests (+9), MIN_TESTS 262→271.
